title: "PlasmidCall: code, frozen models and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen models and derived data for a study of the genomic context of antimicrobial
  resistance determinants in 150 bacterial genomes across six taxa, and of the prospectively
  sealed evaluation of plasmid-origin classification built on those labels.
